        "headline": "Red Flag Warning issued June 24 at 12:15PM AKDT until June 25 at 12:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "The National Weather Service in Fairbanks has issued a Red Flag\nWarning, which is in effect until midnight AKDT tonight.\n\n* AFFECTED AREA...Upper Kobuk Valleys and Lower Koyukuk Valley.\n\n* TIMING...Until midnight AKDT tonight.\n\n* WINDS...Northwest 8 to 15 mph with gusts up to 25 mph.\n\n* HUMIDITY...As low as 20 to 25 percent.\n\n* TEMPERATURES...Highs in the upper 70s to low 80s. Lows in the lower 50s.\n\n* IMPACTS...Critical fire weather conditions are developing\nWednesday due to a combination of ho",
